  "description": "A modern .NET library for reading and writing metadata in media files. Supports 15 formats: MP3 (ID3v1/ID3v2), FLAC, Ogg Vorbis, Ogg Opus, Ogg FLAC, WAV, AIFF, MP4/M4A (AAC/ALAC), ASF/WMA, DSF (DSD), DFF (DSDIFF), WavPack, Monkey's Audio (.ape), Musepack, and APE tags. Clean, span-based API designed for performance. MIT licensed alternative to TagLib#.",
